Package: staRsom
Type: Package
Title: Self-Organizing Maps for EEMs from DOM
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Matthias", "Pucher", email = "matthias.pucher@ecosight.at",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9093-2199"))
Description: Self-organizing maps (SOM, Kohonen 2013) <doi:10.1016/j.neunet.2012.09.018> for
    excitation emission matrix (EEM) data of dissolved organic matter (DOM) prepared with
    'staRdom'. Samples are arranged on a map, grouped by clustering the prototype EEMs and
    fluorescence regions are derived from correlated component planes following
    Ejarque-Gonzalez and Butturini (2014) <doi:10.1371/journal.pone.0099618>. Results can be
    split into sample groups for subsequent PARAFAC analyses.
License: AGPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.4.0), staRdom (>= 1.1.32)
